meta {
  name: 13. Preview Bank Transfer
  type: http
  seq: 13
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/wallet/transfers/quote
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
  Content-Type: application/json
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{authToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "amount": 1000
  }
}

docs {
  # Preview Bank Transfer

  Call this before the transfer confirmation screen. It does not debit the wallet.

  ## Response

  ```json
  {
    "quote": {
      "transferAmount": 1000,
      "fee": 25,
      "totalWalletDebit": 1025,
      "recipientReceives": 1000,
      "currency": "NGN"
    }
  }
  ```

  Display all four amounts from the API. Do not calculate the fee in the frontend.
}
